; Purpose-authored fixture for the visual-regression suite
; (tests/visual/editor-surfaces.visual.spec.ts) -- not a real community
; pack. Lives in its own folder (lifebar-pack/) because the app's folder
; picker only ever reads a lifebar's own .def-style file -- the sprite
; sheet is a separate, unrelated single-file input pointed directly at
; this repo's existing real fixture (src/wasm/testdata/v1-basic.sff), so
; no .sff needs to live alongside this file. See
; .vibe/decisions/012-visual-regression-fixture-reuses-existing-sff-directly.md.
;
; One section with one sprite-reference (".spr") entry, deliberately left
; unset -- the visual spec assigns v1-basic.sff's one real sprite (group 0,
; image 0, 57x103px) to it through the elements editor's own picker, then
; screenshots the result.

[P1 Life Bar]
pos = 20,20
0.spr =
0.offset = 0,0
